  "hint": "Subtract H1 2025 from H1 2026 for each region and compare the differences.",
  "explanation": "Lagos grew by ₦34.6m (118.2 → 152.8). South West grew faster in percentage terms (+79%) but by less money (+₦22.8m).",
  "required": true
}
```


