    "options": ["Deletes the file", "Sends the output of cut into sort", "Runs both at once on the file", "Saves to a file"],
    "answer": 1,
    "explanation": "Pipes join small tools into one answer."
  },
  {
    "prompt": "Why search for `\" 504 \"` rather than `504`?",
